<section class="shell band">
  <h1>How the methods work, in plain language</h1>
  <div class="answer">
    <p>Reem's focus is <strong>IFS-informed EMDR</strong>: EMDR run with parts awareness, so
    the protective parts of you get consulted rather than overridden. It sits alongside two
    other approaches. <strong>Somatic Experiencing</strong> works with the nervous system
    directly, in small doses, to widen what you can tolerate. <strong>NARM</strong> works with
    the patterns that formed in childhood and how they still shape your present. Brainspotting
    comes in where it helps.</p>
  </div>
</section>

